OL,3,AHow Poundland grew from a market stall
OL,4,Ato a high street giant
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I told people what I wanted to
OL,7,Fdo, open shops on the high street
OL,8,Fselling things for one pound, they
OL,9,Fsaid, 'how will you find products to
OL,10,Fsell for a pound, what about inflation,
OL,11,Fit will never work.'"
OL,13,FThat is how Steve Smith, the founder of
OL,14,FPoundland, describes the genesis of the
OL,15,Fbudget giant - which went on to employ
OL,16,Fthousands of people and see over a
OL,17,Fmillion customers a week - on his own
OL,18,Fwebsite.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
