OL,3,AHow Poundland grew from a market stall
OL,4,Ato a high street giant
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut now the West Midlands-based
OL,7,Fretailer is teetering on the edge,
OL,8,Fafter its US-based owners Gordon
OL,9,FBrothers cut off a vital funding supply
OL,10,Fand rejected a takeover offer from
OL,11,FIrish firm Martin Property Group.
OL,13,FHaving spent time on his parents stall
OL,14,Fsince the age of two Wolverhampton-born
OL,15,Fbusinessman Smith started out in the
OL,16,Fvery same place - selling items for #1
OL,17,Ffrom his own stall.
